 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "G'day, doctor. It's Bruce here, Kev's wife, no, sorry, I'm Kev's brother. Kev's got joint pain since a tick bit him, and he won't say. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Bruce. Kev, what's been happening? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um. It's my knee. The right one. It's sore."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long's it been sore?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Three, mate. It was three weeks. You went camping, remember, the long weekend, and you had the tick after."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two. It feels like two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Two to three weeks, then. Does it swell? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had a fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He was burning up on Tuesday night, doctor. He had a fever, he just won't admit it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll write both down. Kev, any allergies, to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um. Penicillin. I'm allergic to it. I get a reaction, but I don't know what. Mum would know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Anything wrong with your health in general?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma. Since I was a kid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at the knee. Roll up the trouser leg.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's swelling of the right knee, and it's warm compared to the left."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's been like that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And on your thigh, I can see a ring-shaped red patch, about the size of a coaster."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's where the tick was, I think. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you get the tick out in one piece? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "With tweezers, yes. I got the head and all. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, that's the right way to do it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I forgot about that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With the knee, the tick, and the ring on the thigh, I can't rule out Lyme disease."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lyme? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's an infection from ticks. I'm not going to guess today. I'd like to see you again in a week to see how it's behaving."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A week. I'll drive him. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get a fever or the knee gets worse before then, ring us. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  }
